# Font index table: index (hex) = character.
# Source: Shift-JIS lookup table at PC 0x1F6F ($80:9F6F), 2 bytes/entry (SJIS byte order), 511 entries.
# (No FFFF terminator in practice: the search always finds a match.)
# VRAM tile for index n: top = (n//16)*32 + n%16, bottom = top + 16 (BG3 char base at VRAM byte 0x8000).
# 000-0FF fixed kana/alnum set; 100-1FE = every kanji used by the game.
